.TH "AG\-CLI\-COMMIT\-LIST" "1" "2026\-10\-09" "AtomGit CLI 0.7.4" "AtomGit CLI Manual"
.SH NAME
\&ag\-cli\-commit\-list \- List commits
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\&ag\-cli commit list [<owner>/<repo>] [flags]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
\&List commits
.PP
\&When OWNER/REPO is omitted, the repository is inferred from the current Git repository. An explicit OWNER/REPO argument always takes precedence. Remote selection prefers remote.pushDefault, the current branch upstream, origin, then a unique AtomGit/GitCode remote.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
\&Output commits as JSON
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-L, \-\-limit <int>\fR
\&Maximum number of commits to list
\&Default: \(dq30\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-path <string>\fR
\&Only list commits that touch the given file path
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-ref <string>\fR
\&Commit SHA or branch name to start from
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-since <string>\fR
\&Only list commits after this time (RFC 3339, e.g. 2024\-11\-08T16:25:44Z)
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-until <string>\fR
\&Only list commits before this time (RFC 3339, e.g. 2024\-11\-08T16:25:44Z)
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.SH INHERITED OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fR
\&Show help for command
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
